{'symbol': 'WST', 'date': '2019-10-23 22:30:00', 'title': 'WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES, INC. RAISES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FULL YEAR 2019', 'text': 'WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES, INC. RAISED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FULL YEAR 2019. THE COMPANY IS RAISING ITS FULL-YEAR 2019 NET SALES GUIDANCE TO A NEW RANGE OF BETWEEN $1.815 BILLION AND $1.825 BILLION, COMPARED TO THE PRIOR GUIDANCE RANGE OF BETWEEN $1.810 BILLION AND $1.825 BILLION. ORGANIC SALES GROWTH IS EXPECTED TO BE APPROXIMATELY 8%. NET SALES GUIDANCE INCLUDES A HEADWIND OF $54 MILLION FOR THE FULL-YEAR 2019 BASED ON CURRENT FOREIGN EXCHANGE RATES, COMPARED TO PRIOR GUIDANCE OF A FULL-YEAR NEGATIVE IMPACT OF $42 MILLION.'}